📌 Project Overview

This project demonstrates a complete Help Desk Ticketing System deployment and workflow simulation using osTicket in a local lab environment.
The goal of this lab was to simulate a real corporate IT Support environment where users submit incidents and agents manage, troubleshoot,
and resolve support tickets.

The project covers:

Ticket creation
Help Topic configuration
Agent assignment
Internal documentation
User communication
Ticket resolution lifecycle

Technologies Used

Linux (Ubuntu)
Apache Web Server
PHP
MySQL Database
osTicket Ticketing System
Localhost Lab Environment

Lab Setup
✔️ Installed osTicket locally

Configured:
Web server
Database connection
Admin panel access
Support Center portal

✔️ Created Help Desk Structure

Configured custom Help Topics including:
Hardware Issue
Software Issue
Network Connectivity
Security Alert
General Inquiry

✔️ Ticket Workflow Simulation:
Simulated real end-user support requests through the Support Center portal.

Example incidents created:

Laptop not powering on(Hardware Issue)
Suspicious login notification(Security Alert)
Outlook application crash(Software Issues)
Office WiFi connectivity issue(Network Connectivity)
Incident Handling Process(Account Access)

